{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CtGNMvx4jH7kPVaV9AwfWL","type":"tool_result","content":"  _fire(s, then) {\n    if (!s.event) return false;\n    const f = this.on[s.event];\n    if (f) try { f(this, s); } catch (e) { this.game.fail('story event \"' + s.event + '\"', e); }\n    else E.warn('story:on:' + s.event, 'E.Story: no handler for event \"' + s.event + '\" (on: { ' + s.event + '(story, step) {...} })');\n    if (!this.running) return true;\n    if (s.wait) { this._held = true; this._then = then || null; return true; }\n    return false;\n  }\n  _jump(id) {\n    if (!this.nodes[id]) { E.warn('story:' + id, 'E.Story: no node \"' + id + '\" (a goto)'); this._end(); return false; }\n    this.node = id; this._steps = this.nodes[id]; this._i = 0; return true;\n  }\n  // a step's or a choice's actions: set, add, quest, done, emote, end (its event: _fire)\n    if (!this._held) this.talk.update(dt);\n    return this.running;\n  }\n  /** a flag or value (key may be a dotted path into vars) */\n  get(key) { let v = this.vars; for (const k of String(key).split('.')) v = v == null ? undefined : v[k]; return v; }\n12280:  done(a, cost = 100) { if (this.mode === 'ct') a._turn -= cost; else if (this.mode === 'atb') a._turn = 0; }\n12281-  /** atb: fill the gauges on game time (dt seconds) */\n12282-  update(dt) { if (this.mode === 'atb') for (const a of this.actors) a._turn = Math.min(100, a._turn + (a.speed === undefined ? 100 : a.speed) * this.fill * dt); }\n12283-  /** atb: the actors whose gauges are full, in the order they were added */\n--\n12872:  done(rh) } }).\n12873-- chart: a string a lane, a character a step of the song: 'x' a note, 'h' a held note's head and '=' while it is\n12874-  held, 'c' a call (PaRappa's teacher: it sounds and shows, the player answers after), '.' none; '|' and spaces are\n12875-  ignored. Or { parts: { A: [lanes], B: [lanes] }, order: 'A A B A' } (the parts one after another), or { track: 1,\n--\n14064:  quest(id, title = id, text = '') {\n14065-    const q = this.quests.find(q => q.id === id);","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"812255b0-ea3a-4ee3-85b0-07e0e895a85a","uuid":"5167eabb-d599-487b-baae-1dbbb3a53c5a","timestamp":"2026-11-03T02:15:48.358Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"  _fire(s, then) {\n    if (!s.event) return false;\n    const f = this.on[s.event];\n    if (f) try { f(this, s); } catch (e) { this.game.fail('story event \"' + s.event + '\"', e); }\n    else E.warn('story:on:' + s.event, 'E.Story: no handler for event \"' + s.event + '\" (on: { ' + s.event + '(story, step) {...} })');\n    if (!this.running) return true;\n    if (s.wait) { this._held = true; this._then = then || null; return true; }\n    return false;\n  }\n  _jump(id) {\n    if (!this.nodes[id]) { E.warn('story:' + id, 'E.Story: no node \"' + id + '\" (a goto)'); this._end(); return false; }\n    this.node = id; this._steps = this.nodes[id]; this._i = 0; return true;\n  }\n  // a step's or a choice's actions: set, add, quest, done, emote, end (its event: _fire)\n    if (!this._held) this.talk.update(dt);\n    return this.running;\n  }\n  /** a flag or value (key may be a dotted path into vars) */\n  get(key) { let v = this.vars; for (const k of String(key).split('.')) v = v == null ? undefined : v[k]; return v; }\n12280:  done(a, cost = 100) { if (this.mode === 'ct') a._turn -= cost; else if (this.mode === 'atb') a._turn = 0; }\n12281-  /** atb: fill the gauges on game time (dt seconds) */\n12282-  update(dt) { if (this.mode === 'atb') for (const a of this.actors) a._turn = Math.min(100, a._turn + (a.speed === undefined ? 100 : a.speed) * this.fill * dt); }\n12283-  /** atb: the actors whose gauges are full, in the order they were added */\n--\n12872:  done(rh) } }).\n12873-- chart: a string a lane, a character a step of the song: 'x' a note, 'h' a held note's head and '=' while it is\n12874-  held, 'c' a call (PaRappa's teacher: it sounds and shows, the 